# Generated test runs of the map scripts (friction_map_from_point.py,
# map_from_airport.py, friction_surface_map.py, plot_h3_map.py) - can be
# regenerated at any time via CLI call, otherwise they pile up unversioned
# over many test runs. Reference examples already tracked with git add
# (e.g. h3_travel_times_map_from_thu_thule_air_base.png) are unaffected -
# .gitignore only applies to files not yet tracked.
